Democracy Defender Mod Manager (DDMM) — https://github.com/katsyk/DemocracyDefenderModManager

This is a derivative work of Helldivers 2 Mod Manager, original work Copyright teutinsa
(https://github.com/teutinsa/Helldivers2ModManager), licensed under Apache-2.0.

Modifications made in DDMM: source-neutral mod sources, folder installs, direct-URL installs,
archive path-traversal/symlink extraction hardening, and the rebrand from Helldivers2ModManager
to Democracy Defender Mod Manager.

Ordnance Mod Manager — https://github.com/Cavadus/ordnance

This is a fork of Democracy Defender Mod Manager. Ordnance keeps DDMM's
patch-file deploy and adds a stat-mod compiler: enabled edits are applied
in profile order and resealed into one .dl_bin per game table.
